---
import "../styles/global.css";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<main id="stack" class="bg-[#1E293B] py-16">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 lg:px-12">
    
    <div class="mb-10 md:mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white font-semibold">Stack Técnico</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 mt-3 md:mt-4 text-sm md:text-base">
        Herramientas y tecnologías que uso para crear productos digitales.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8 items-stretch w-full">
      
      <div class="bg-[#253040] rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center px-6 pt-6 md:px-8 md:pt-8 gap-3">
            <Icon name="material-symbols:format-paint" class="text-white text-3xl shrink-0" />
            <h2 class="text-white text-xl md:text-2xl">Frontend</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 md:px-8 mt-5">
            <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 text-gray-200 gap-y-2 gap-x-4">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-400"></span>React.js</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-400"></span>Vue.js</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600"></span>TypeScript</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span>TailwindCSS</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#171E2B] m-4 md:m-6 p-4 md:p-5 rounded-lg">
          <p class="text-gray-300 italic text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Enfocado en crear interfaces de usuario fluidas y de alto rendimiento con un fuerte énfasis en la accesibilidad y la estética.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#253040] rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center px-6 pt-6 md:px-8 md:pt-8 gap-3">
            <Icon name="material-symbols:build" class="text-white text-3xl shrink-0" />
            <h2 class="text-white text-xl md:text-2xl">Backend</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 md:px-8 mt-5">
            <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 text-gray-200 gap-y-2 gap-x-4">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>Nest.js</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400"></span>PHP</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-400"></span>Java</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#171E2B] m-4 md:m-6 p-4 md:p-5 rounded-lg">
          <p class="text-gray-300 italic text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Construyendo la arquitectura de sistemas del lado del servidor robustos y escalables, y diseñando modelos de datos eficientes relacionales y NoSQL.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#253040] rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center px-6 pt-6 md:px-8 md:pt-8 gap-3">
            <Icon name="material-symbols:database" class="text-white text-3xl shrink-0" />
            <h2 class="text-white text-xl md:text-2xl">Infrastructure</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 md:px-8 mt-5">
            <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 text-gray-200 gap-y-2 gap-x-4">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500"></span>Docker</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-300"></span>MySQL</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-600"></span>PostgreSQL</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-400"></span>Apache</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#171E2B] m-4 md:m-6 p-4 md:p-5 rounded-lg">
          <p class="text-gray-300 italic text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Utilizando herramientas modernas para agilizar la experiencia del desarrollador y garantizar la calidad del código mediante pruebas rigurosas.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</main>